<title>UK: QUALITY: Lufthansa Q2 UK cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY: Lufthansa Q2 UK cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, a unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, has issued its report on service standards it achieved at London Heathrow airport between April-June 1997.</p>
<p>The following achievements for Q2 based on customer commitments made by Lufthansa are compared with those for Q1 1997.</p>
<p>Commitment by Lufthansa    Achievement  Q2 97    Q1 97</p>
<p>Average delivery queuing time</p>
<p>    (side-load) - 45 mins		   26 mins  38 mins</p>
<p>Average delivery queuing time</p>
<p>    (back-load) - 30 mins		   22 mins  25 mins</p>
<p>Average import collection time</p>
<p>			30 mins		   18 mins  21 mins</p>
<p>Flown as booked				 96.0pct  94.3pct</p>
<p>Claims - initial response within</p>
<p>    seven working days			99 0pct  98.0pct</p>
<p>Claims -final settlement within 4 weeks 99.0pct  99.00pct Import documents available to customer within:</p>
<p>    90 mins (passenger aircraft)	  98.2pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>    60 mins (freighter aircraft)	  98.2pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>Express documents available to customer within:</p>
<p>    60 mins (passenger aircraft)	  98.2pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>Express documents available to customer within:</p>
<p>    30 mins (freighter aircraft)........98.2pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>Import freight available within:</p>
<p>    6 hours (wide-body and cargo a/c)   97.0pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>    2 hours (narrow-body aircraft)	97.0pct  99.2pct</p>
<p>Import express freight available within:</p>
<p>    2 hours (wide-body)		     99.8pct  98.9pct</p>
<p>1.5 hrs (freighter and</p>
<p>	    wide-body aircraft)	     99.8pct  98.9pct</p>
<p>Handling reports (initial acknowledgment</p>
<p>of request and completion within 5</p>
<p>   working days)				99.0pct  97.6pct</p>
<p>Telephone answering - answered within</p>
<p>20 seconds (performances available for Q2 only)</p>
<p>    Accounts				    99.10pct</p>
<p>    Sales					 93.90pct</p>
<p>    Reservations				99.90pct</p>
<p>    Express reservations		    94.20pct</p>
<p>    Exports				     97.10pct</p>
<p>    Imports				     96.90pct</p>
